282
00:21:42,060 --> 00:21:46,960
The six glass plates show construction
documentation of the manufacturers and liberal

283
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:50,280
arts building. Not finished documentation.

284
00:21:51,360 --> 00:21:54,180
Not the building as it appeared during the
