285
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:58,840
Construction documentation. Work in
progress.

286
00:22:00,180 --> 00:22:05,620
The kind of images taken to record the
building state at a particular stage of the

287
00:22:05,620 --> 00:22:11,360
construction timeline. The kind of images are
supervising engineer orders when the project

288
00:22:11,360 --> 00:22:13,480
has reached a milestone worth recording.

289
00:22:14,380 --> 00:22:19,640
The manufacturers and liberal arts building
was the largest building in the world at

290
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:24,220
the time of the fair. Four hundred and
forty seven meters long.

291
00:22:24,900 --> 00:22:28,120
More than two million square feet of
interior space.

292
00:22:29,030 --> 00:22:33,920
The steel and wood framing of a structure
