296
00:22:46,260 --> 00:22:48,780
The photographs show completed facades.

297
00:22:49,540 --> 00:22:53,900
Completed neoclassical facades on the
manufacturers and liberal arts building.

298
00:22:54,540 --> 00:22:56,540
The columns. The entablature.

299
00:22:57,300 --> 00:23:01,660
The decorative band course. The palasters
flanking the entry pavilion.

300
00:23:02,580 --> 00:23:08,260
All of it finished or nearly finished to a
degree consistent with late stage construction

301
00:23:08,260 --> 00:23:12,620
or completion. And the glass plates carry
