306
00:23:30,260 --> 00:23:33,380
Indicating the period in which the plate
was produced.

307
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:40,900
The six glass plates carry date codes
consistent with early 1891.

308
00:23:42,040 --> 00:23:47,980
Physical construction at Jackson Park
began in January of 1891.

309
00:23:49,140 --> 00:23:54,700
The official construction timeline for the
manufacturers and liberal arts building places

310
00:23:54,700 --> 00:23:58,380
the completion of the facade in late 1892.

311
00:23:59,220 --> 00:24:01,660
Approximately two years after
groundbreaking.

312
00:24:02,380 --> 00:24:09,060
For the facade shown in the construction
would have had

313
00:24:09,060 --> 00:24:13,720
to progress at a rate significantly faster
than the documented timeline.

314
00:24:14,740 --> 00:24:19,640
Or the photographs are showing a state of
completion that the timeline cannot account

315
00:24:19,640 --> 00:24:24,960
for. The official explanation exists and
it is the correct place to start.

316
00:24:25,900 --> 00:24:27,400
Glass plates were reused.

317
00:24:28,360 --> 00:24:30,700
The date code indicates plate manufacture.

318
00:24:31,120 --> 00:24:32,520
Not photograph exposure.

319
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:38,900
Supervising engineers sometimes staged
construction photographs for official record.

320
00:24:39,560 --> 00:24:43,600
Documenting completed sections in advance
of the overall project schedule.

321
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:46,120
These are reasonable explanations.

322
00:24:47,100 --> 00:24:50,800
They account for the anomaly without
