323
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:57,500
The record notes them. The record also notes
that the Halstead negatives are six plates.

324
00:24:58,480 --> 00:25:01,100
Not a systematic documentation series.

325
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:05,880
Six plates from what would have been a
